Package: LLMLineListMSFApp
Title: Extract Outbreak Line Lists With Large Language Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Billy", "Quilty", , "bquilty25@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts structured outbreak line lists from narrative reports
    with large language models. The package provides reusable document
    ingestion, prompt generation, provider runtime, structured parsing,
    comparison, and metrics utilities, together with a packaged Shiny app
    launcher and bundled demo assets.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
